WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
ano toki umareta no

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
あのとき生まれたの

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
I'll softly give you my thoughts

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
watashi no omoi sotto ageru

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
私の想いそっとあげる

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
That were born at that moment

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
shinjite ite

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
信じていて

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
Please believe in them

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
deatta hi kara

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
出逢った日から

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
Since the day when we met

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
hajimete no kimochi megutteru

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
初めての気持ち巡ってる

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
For the first time, I have these feelings, and they go around

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
honto no egao hoshii nante

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
ホントの笑顔ほしいなんて

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
I want your true smile

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
anata ga oshiete kureta sorao

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
あなたが教えてくれた空を

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
I embrace the sky

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
dakishimete yume o miru

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
抱きしめて夢をみる

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
That you told me about and dream

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
tooi keredo・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
遠いけれど・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
It's faraway, but...

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
atatakai hikari no kakera

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
あたたかい光のかけら

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
The fragments of warm light

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
kizutsuita hane ni inochi o kureta no

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
傷ついた羽根に命をくれたの

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
Gave life to my wounded wings

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
fureta toki umareta

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
触れたとき生まれた

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
Born at the moment when we touched

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
tsuyoi watashi no soba ni

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
強い私のそばに

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
Next to me, who is strong

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
mamoraretai watashi ga nemutte ita no

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
守られたいわたしが眠っていたの

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
The me who wants to be protected was asleep

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
sou unmei kaerareru ne

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
そう運命変えられるね

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
That's right, destiny can be changed

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
futari no koi mezamesasete・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
ふたりの恋目覚めさせて・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
Let our love awaken...

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:29.940
{last frame of OP}

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.090
Houzuki-sempai.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.340
Yes?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.660
Did you get any mail or anything from Shinkurou?

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.500
Why?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.450
Hello?

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.460
Okay, I got it.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.730
I'll buy it on my way home.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.400
Yeah, bye.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.200
Who was it?

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.260
My dad.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.670
Really?

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.450
What is it?

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.020
Nothing.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.810
Does Shinkurou even know where the Inner Sanctuary is?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:18.820
Twelfth Episode 「I Am」

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:18.180
This is good...

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.430
We have to cross that mountain to get to the Inner Sanctuary.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:33.720
No, I won't be going over there.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.850
Lin, Benika has probably left the premises already.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:46.990
Why do you think so?

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.300
These footprints head towards the outside,

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:50.860
and they're the same as the trespasser's.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.090
She probably just took her subordinate outside.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.040
No way.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.130
This is an expensive car too!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.110
Don't touch it with your filthy hands.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.240
Who are you?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.450
You... Are you Benika's subordinate?

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.880
I just hate women who don't realize that they've been dumped.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.330
You're... Murasaki's father?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.470
I'm the head of this household.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.450
I came to see Murasaki.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.030
You mean to take her away, don't you?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.740
If she wishes to go outside, then I will take her.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.430
What she wishes for is not of importance,

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:27.270
she cannot leave this hou-

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:28.630
I know!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.060
That's why I came.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.330
Free her!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.440
I have no intention of talking to a man like you.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.050
Leave.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.600
If you resist, then you will die here.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.550
I won't die.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.410
You will.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.800
If we had ever felt like it, you see.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.180
You're all abnormal!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.170
So what?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:54.390
Do you think we've been doing this and not ever had anyone criticize us before?

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.720
Don't you question it?

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:01.340
There's no point in taking away everything these women have and then thinking you have to protect them!

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.350
We are the Kuhouins.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.410
Don't force the general society's views upon us.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.800
No matter the household or place,

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.410
you shouldn't be taking away everything from someone!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.650
What a child.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:16.520
Just what is Benika thinking, taking this child with her?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.250
Even if I'm a child, I'm more correct than you are!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.660
You only think that because you don't understand anything nor can you do anything about it.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:25.550
No.

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.790
You believe what you're thinking now is correct.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:32.630
You believe that there is nothing other than what you're angry at, but that's all a misunderstanding.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:33.690
That's not it!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.230
I can see it.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:43.530
I can see that what awaits you is the same fate as the person who said the same things you are.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.890
People can live where there is no light.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:53.030
But you have neither the courage nor the mind to abandon it yourself.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.150
Murasaki abandoned the light.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.180
She abandoned it for our sake.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.090
You cannot understand her determination for the Kuhouin will,

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.590
nor can you even understand her thoughts.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:09.410
Souju-san also did that, and she died for it, didn't she?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.730
She was a weak willed woman.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.670
She was strong!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.140
That's why she was killed by you!

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.840
Killed?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.930
You say I killed her?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:43.530
Murasaki said she didn't want to become like her mother!

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.150
She...

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.730
She said she didn't want to become like Souju?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.800
Did she really say that?

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.680
That's right.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.560
Stay away!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:08.820
Shinkurou!

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:09.760
Yes!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:10.950
You bastards!

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.630
Let's go!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.800
Hey!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.460
Someone! Is no one there?!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.680
So you could still move.

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.890
You know, there's something I want to try.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.770
What is it?

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:37.310
A technique.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.190
I've already seen it.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.230
I haven't used it yet.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.730
Really?

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.280
Come on up.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.240
I'll show it to you.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.140
How hopeless.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.830
This choice of yours is foolish.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.830
Even if it's reckless, I believe it's correct.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.840
Acting half-heartedly strong will be your undoing.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.010
Shinkurou!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.690
That's...!

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.400
These aren't just moves that Benika-san taught me.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.780
What nonsense.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.150
It's the Houzuki-ryuu!

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:40.210
I wasn't just observing Kurenai Shinkurou!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.670
Murasaki!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.540
That person is my brother, Shinkurou.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.570
So?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:05.480
So...!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.210
It's okay now!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.080
You don't have to force yourself to say things to save me anymore!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.760
Do you really want to stay here?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.100
Don't you want to go outside?

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.200
I...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.950
You trash! Don't deceive Murasaki!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.170
No! I'm asking her what she wants to do!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:26.690
I will respect her choice.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:27.670
Shinkurou...

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.910
If you want to leave this place,

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:34.220
I will protect you.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.350
I promised you, after all.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.880
Murasaki!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.140
I...

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.450
I...

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.900
I want to leave the Inner Sanctuary!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:03.920
I can't believe cars could move so well in the garden.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.160
What a stench.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.850
Benika!

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:24.990
As usual, such a scary face.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.390
Do you know why I'm in a bad mood?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.650
Because it's forbidden to park in the Inner Sanctuary?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.660
Come here, Murasaki.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.610
Nothing good will come from following that woman.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:36.390
How rude.

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:38.390
We'll be taking her with us.

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.490
I want her to live freely outside.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.670
Could you shut up for a bit?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.680
This is a family problem.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.290
I don't know where or what you've heard,

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.200
but in worlds that you don't know of,
imprisonment is also a form of preservation.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.230
Even though so many women have gone through terrible experiences?

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.190
That's right.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.550
It means that one cannot have everything go their way.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:00.180
Hey, let's have her decide.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.470
Women of the Inner Sanctuary do not have that liberty!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:03.990
Then, no!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.500
I will leave the Inner Sanctuary.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.150
Murasaki!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.170
I cannot see any happiness here,

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.730
and I hate not being able to go outside!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.270
What would you do after going outside?

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.750
I want to fall in love.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.450
Just like how mother fell in love with you,

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:19.530
I want to fall in love and be with that person!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.280
Who taught her all this?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.370
You can live as a woman born to the Kuhouins!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.710
Then what about mother?

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.570
What about Souju?

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.380
You are my child. A Kuhouin child!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:34.630
My mother, Souju, loved you and that's why she gave birth to me.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:37.220
What selfish words.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.620
Please forget about the Inner Sanctuary.{following conversation between Murasaki and Renjou is super formal, please reflect that if possible}

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.770
Please.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:46.270
What do you think will happen, then?

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:53.260
I do not wish to stay in a place that ignores someone when they speak of their sadness.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.860
You're forsaking the Kuhouins? {leaving -> forsake (formal)}

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.940
No, I will not desert the Kuhouins. {leave -> desert (formal)}

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:00.950
I want to leave the Inner Sanctuary.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.160
Then...

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.760
I'm not forcing myself to say this.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.120
This is what it means to fight, right?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.920
If I follow you now, then I will be running away.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.960
What do you mean?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.070
I've seen many Kuhouins smile.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.690
I have no intention of denying that.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:27.010
But if they are crooked smiles,

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.180
I will not accept them.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:33.550
The Inner Sanctuary continues to exist because we Kuhouins do.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.400
It is our family's custom!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:40.910
My mother did not give birth to me simply because she was a Kuhouin woman!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.910
Are you saying that Souju was not happy in the Inner Sanctuary?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:51.580
She simply forgot that she was a woman of the Inner Sanctuary and lusted for things.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.340
She was often sad <i>because </i>she had these desires.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:58.000
So are you saying that it is okay to have nothing?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.400
That is the duty of a woman of the Inner Sanctuary.

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:01.970
That includes you, Murasaki.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:06.680
I do not want to be in a place that crushes my will.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.660
I want to choose my partner with my own eyes.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:13.950
And in order to do that, I must learn many things and to train my eyes.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.490
Renjou-sama!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.810
Accept Murasaki!

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:26.990
Shut up, you brat.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.500
Let me go!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:33.470
Someone!

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.930
Someone! Do something!

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:38.340
Ryuuji-san!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:41.840
Don't move!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:47.140
I will leave Murasaki here.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:54.080
In exchange, let her out of the Inner Sanctuary as she wishes!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.230
Do you think I can do that?

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.620
You're the head of the family, aren't you?!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.200
What about the Inner Sanctuary, then?

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.180
That's up to you.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.780
Murasaki will fight the Kuhouin traditions.

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:10.320
Whether Murasaki ends up like Souju or not is up to her.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.950
Like Souju...

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:21.050
If she comes to love Ryuuji, then that is also fine.

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.130
If not, then give up for her.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.090
Souju...

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.550
Dear...

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.810
Why are you letting them say what they want?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:33.060
It isn't just Kuhouin women that are obedient to this household!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.060
Souju-san gave up on you and died.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.690
Father!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.660
Even though she loved you, she died!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.720
Father!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.950
This is Souju's wish too!

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:47.070
Souju's... wish...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.370
Grant it.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.370
Please.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:54.960
Shut up, woman!

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:02.800
Benika-sama?

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:13.440
I won't let someone like you destroy the Kuhouins! {}

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.130
You don't realize the sorrow that you'll cause.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.330
I won't make the same mistakes as my father!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.940
It's not a mistake!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.070
It could become an opportunity.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.030
Ryuuji-san!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.800
Stop!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:53.950
A horn...

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:54.520
The Houzuki's horn!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.890
It's because of you!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:16:00.380
It's because people like you exist that everyone cries!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.980
Free Murasaki!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.200
She's crying!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.630
She always cries!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.870
A household which allows that should just disappear!

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.080
And yet a man like you exists?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.160
You attached that thing to your body,

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.500
that thing from a family of killers!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.410
I won't kill!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.720
I'm different from you!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.190
Shinkurou!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.820
What is that?

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.080
Why do you have that?

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:35.780
I changed my body at the Houzuki's.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:41.690
I wished for it, and had a weapon put into my body.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.860
I had to do it.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:48.130
I had to do this in order to become stronger by myself.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.030
Is that so?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.890
But I was wrong.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:55.660
Everyone was supporting me.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.000
I only thought that I was alone.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.620
Do you regret it?

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.820
I do.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.700
That's why I swore that I would never use it.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.240
But it still comes out.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.920
It can't be helped.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.220
I'm still weak.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.470
You're like me then.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.980
I must change too.

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:24.150
Change?

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.530
That's right.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:27.160
I'm just like you.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.140
I will fight the Kuhouin customs here.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.660
Fight...

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:39.310
Well, I thought you were walking much further ahead of me.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:41.680
But you're the same as me.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.830
I thought I couldn't catch up with you,

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.250
but it looks like I can still make it.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.620
Shinkurou.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:55.510
Why do you fight so much for Murasaki?

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.400
For my sake,

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.770
and because I can't leave this poor child alone!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.770
Poor...

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:06.020
Free Murasaki!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.690
People who steal her freedom, I will...!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.870
Murasaki said she will fight here.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.960
Murasaki.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:16.660
You will fight me from now on, right?

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.200
Yes.

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.050
Then fight.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.130
Shinkurou.

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:26.350
Come here when Murasaki loses.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:29.240
I will face you then.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:34.550
Of course, I don't know whether she will be worth saving or not after she loses.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:35.970
Dear...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.540
Even without this place, the Kuhouins will not collapse.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.140
Is that fine with you?!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:46.190
I am the head of the Kuhouins.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.710
I will protect this household.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.610
I will protect you all.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.860
There is nothing to worry about.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:57.570
I will look after the Kuhouins too.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:01.840
I have no intention to reject the Kuhouins right now.

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:05.350
I will grow older as a Kuhouin woman.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.650
However, I will not live my life as one does in the Inner Sanctuary.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:11.680
I will search for my own way to live.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:14.720
Just like mother,

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.090
I will fall in love.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.480
Does your arm hurt?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.270
It's okay.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.250
Shinkurou.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.340
You should not step on the threshold.

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:41.130
Is that so?

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:44.240
Ah, that's right.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.660
This is from Yamie-san.

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:50.650
It's a fox.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.450
And this is from Tamaki-san.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:58.430
It's wet, so I'll send you another one next time.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:04.100
If I had known in the beginning what was lying in wait for me,

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.730
I wouldn't have set off.

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:12.150
It may just be my optimism in believing that I can do it, or simply curiosity,

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:15.930
but I'm looking forward to seeing new things.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:22.260
I don't know if it will be encounters with people or my new will.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:26.950
But that's exactly why I cannot stay behind you.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.540
I won't pretend.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:32.170
I want to face it head on, and not just in heart.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:38.260
And if the person I love is beside me then, I'm sure that I'll be happy.

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:41.010
Because I can love.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.230
You'll learn many things.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.380
You'll begin to learn.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.180
This is farewell, Shinkurou.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:51.790
You don't say farewell at times like this.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.690
You say, "See you again."

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.440
I see.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.190
See you again, Shinkurou.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.350
See you again.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:11.510
Wouldn't you normally call for an ambulance?

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:14.520
We cannot let this become a public matter.

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:18.770
That man has never been kind.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:22.220
How did Souju come to like him?

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:24.760
Maybe because she didn't know the outside?

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:29.020
Plus, he looked pretty cool.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:30.930
That's your type?

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.020
He's not bad.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.950
So someone like that is your type.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:36.170
Shut up.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.280
That's why you're so cold to me.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.730
Yamie-san!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.870
Y-Yamie-san!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.310
Show me yours.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.830
No way.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.460
It's so cold that I could die.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.960
I'm on my way back to Samidare now.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.720
I don't have any souvenirs.

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:04.260
What? Tell him to go buy some shochu!

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.110
No way.

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:13.470
What did you see outside, Murasaki?

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:14.960
Many things.

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.620
A cramped room, a smelly futon,

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.240
noisy and strange people,

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:23.490
a small sky in a crowded city.

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:25.360
Was it fun there?

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:26.940
Very much so.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:29.330
Were there any inconveniences?

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:30.530
There were.

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:34.400
The bath was far, and there was only one room.

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:37.100
I had to share the toilet with everyone too.

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:41.150
I got scolded at for doing things I thought were natural.

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:44.350
My meals were simple and always tasted the same.

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:47.770
But, I laughed a lot.

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.310
I see.

00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:54.390
Did mother ever laugh before you?

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:57.630
She cried a lot,

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.340
but there were also times when she laughed.

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:04.280
Please tell me stories of when she laughed, father.

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:10.030
She smiled the most when she was holding you when you were young.

00:23:12.010 --> 00:23:15.450
Just like the quiet blossoming violets by the bridge in the garden,

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.040
she held onto your small body.

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:23.410
So that no one would step on you like the violets,

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:25.640
she held on to you

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:27.580
preciously.

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:32.210
I am Kuhouin Murasaki.

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:36.810
I had forgotten to ask Kurenai Shinkurou-sama one thing.

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:39.360
Shinkurou?

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:42.820
Do you love me?

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:46.450
I was dreaming.

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:50.820
A dream where we walked together again.

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:54.330
It was a narrow path,

00:23:54.790 --> 00:24:03.710
but it was a happy, and peaceful, hilly road where the violets were blossoming.
